  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nFriendship between crowns is a story the weak tell the strong. I deal, I do not befriend, and I am never surprised when someone's friend turns on them. In this I go further than anyone at this table.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I have not yet needed anything from another ruler, and I do not know what I do when I must ask. Whoever I ask first will teach me whether asking is safe, and I will treat the rest of the table by what I learn. I have given my word to no one yet, and no one has given theirs to me. Whether I am the one who stands or the one who slips away is not written, and the first hard hour beside an ally will write it for good.",
  "Fr-3 Ne\0771 Lo\0772", "", 153, "friendship=table- loyalty=unwritten\077 neediness=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 5", "Oman", "", "6 5 5 6 5 4 6 6 6 5 6 6", "", "", "16 8 9 14 9;11 4 8 7 13;7 10 12 10 9;13 12 15 7 6;12 16 12 13 7;5 7 4 8 12;13 12 5 11 14;7 14 16 11 13;7 10 6 12 13;15 11 12 8 10;5 16 6 14 6;11 9 4 15 15", "game-5:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether I am a ruler who has friends or one who has uses for people. The first hand offered me across this table will be answered one way or the other, and the answer will stick. I do not know yet what a conqueror is to me, a criminal or a teacher. The first city that changes hands in my sight will decide it, for its taker and for me.",
  "Fr\0772 Wh\0772", "", 84, "friendship=unwritten\077 warhate=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 6", "Oman", "Yugoslavia", "5 4 5 6 4 4 4 6 5 5 4 5", "4 6 5 6 5 6 5 4 6 6 4 6", "", "4 10 13 8 5;16 6 6 12 8;9 13 7 6 7;10 16 5 6 16;8 15 14 13 6;7 7 7 8 13;7 4 9 11 13;6 5 16 16 5;5 8 15 14 9;9 6 4 11 12;12 7 4 16 16;16 8 15 5 15", "game-6:1",
  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what I do when one crown grows heavier than all the rest: lean against it, or sell it my friendship. The first ruler to rise that far will learn which, and so will those hoping for my help. I have given my word to no one yet, and no one has given theirs to me. Whether I am the one who stands or the one who slips away is not written, and the first hard hour beside an ally will write it for good.",
  "Ba\0771 Lo\0772", "", 113, "loyalty=unwritten\077 balance=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 7", "Oman", "", "5 4 6 5 4 5 4 6 5 4 5 5", "", "", "7 12 7 6 5;11 11 5 10 7;16 4 8 12 10;8 6 9 15 6;10 12 4 12 11;7 5 16 10 7;15 7 6 9 11;10 14 11 6 15;8 6 4 12 16;8 15 11 11 16;6 7 10 15 9;16 6 8 12 15", "game-7:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether I am one who names an enemy before the whole table or one who smiles until the hour. The first ruler I come to despise will get one or the other, and the table will know me by it. I do not know yet what my word is worth. No promise of mine has been tested, and the first time keeping one costs me I will learn whether I am a ruler who pays, and so will everyone watching.",
