{ "flat 13", "Oman", "", "4 5 6 5 4 5 4 6 4 5 5 4", "", "", "6 7 14 9 13;9 9 12 6 12;6 4 14 16 11;13 9 8 11 16;15 13 14 10 6;4 9 8 4 14;14 5 11 16 16;7 11 10 5 6;15 4 11 15 8;16 4 16 9 7;9 6 9 12 12;12 4 7 6 4", "game-13:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nI watch how the others weigh against each other, always. A ruler grown too heavy is a danger to everyone, and I lean against the heaviest without waiting to be asked. No one sitting here is more this way than I am.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I have not yet stood over anyone who could not stop me, and I do not know what I do there. Whatever I do the first time, I expect I will do again. I have not yet seen a ruler take another's city by force, and I do not know what rises in me when I do: disgust or appetite. The first conqueror at this table will show me, and will be treated by it ever after.",
