  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nMy word is a tool like any other. I give it freely and take it back when the ground shifts, and I think the rulers who do otherwise are fools I can use. Of all the crowns here, mine holds to this hardest.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. No one has wronged me yet, and I do not know what I do to the first who does; whatever it is, everyone after will expect it. I do not know yet what I do when one crown grows heavier than all the rest: lean against it, or sell it my friendship. The first ruler to rise that far will learn which, and so will those hoping for my help.",
  "Lo-2 Fo\0771 Ba\0771", "", 137, "loyalty=table- balance=unwritten\077 forgiveness=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 17", "Oman", "", "4 4 4 6 5 6 6 4 6 5 4 4", "", "", "9 7 5 9 6;10 5 5 13 6;16 8 15 5 8;7 4 10 4 4;9 11 9 12 13;14 11 16 5 15;6 6 11 10 4;4 5 13 16 13;9 10 14 12 4;8 8 10 13 13;4 13 11 9 15;6 11 12 6 16", "game-17:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nA chance half sure is a chance; I move while others are still counting. No one sitting here is more this way than I am. I ask for what I need and I expect my friends to give it. Each refusal is weighed, and I do not have many refusals in me. No one sitting here is more this way than I am.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what a conqueror is to me, a criminal or a teacher. The first city that changes hands in my sight will decide it, for its taker and for me. I do not know yet whether I am a ruler who has friends or one who has uses for people. The first hand offered me across this table will be answered one way or the other, and the answer will stick.",
  "Bo+1 Ne+1 Wh\0772 Fr\0772", "", 147, "boldness=table+ friendship=unwritten\077 neediness=table+ warhate=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 18", "Oman", "Yugoslavia", "4 5 6 6 6 5 4 5 5 5 5 6", "6 4 5 4 6 6 5 6 5 5 6 5", "", "7 14 12 15 8;10 6 6 5 11;10 11 13 12 10;7 7 9 7 11;10 5 11 4 5;9 11 9 10 16;14 16 8 16 16;15 15 15 15 13;14 4 15 12 10;11 5 9 14 13;5 5 11 8 8;5 4 15 6 10", "game-18:1",
  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nI want friends at this table and I offer my hand first. I ask the same warmth back, and a hand that stays closed tells me what I need to know about its owner. Of all the crowns here, mine holds to this hardest. I do not keep the world's scales. Let them rise and ruin each other as they like; I count only what each one is to me. In this I go further than anyone at this table.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what a conqueror is to me, a criminal or a teacher. The first city that changes hands in my sight will decide it, for its taker and for me. No one has wronged me yet, and I do not know what I do to the first who does; whatever it is, everyone after will expect it.",
  "Fr+2 Ba-2 Wh\0772 Fo\0771", "", 165, "friendship=table+ balance=table- forgiveness=unwritten\077 warhate=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 19", "Oman", "", "5 6 6 4 4 5 4 5 6 4 6 4", "", "", "8 4 10 7 4;7 16 10 8 15;16 4 15 14 12;4 6 13 10 16;14 9 6 4 4;11 9 8 11 5;11 4 12 7 8;16 16 13 9 6;11 13 7 7 10;14 14 5 4 13;12 15 8 10 12;5 8 15 15 9", "game-19:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what my word is worth. No promise of mine has been tested, and the first time keeping one costs me I will learn whether I am a ruler who pays, and so will everyone watching. I do not know yet what I do when one crown grows heavier than all the rest: lean against it, or sell it my friendship. The first ruler to rise that far will learn which, and so will those hoping for my help.",
  "Lo\0771 Ba\0771", "", 92, "loyalty=unwritten\077 balance=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 20", "Oman", "Yugoslavia", "6 5 5 4 4 4 5 5 5 6 5 4", "4 6 6 6 4 5 5 6 5 4 4 4", "", "5 14 12 6 7;10 10 16 10 12;11 12 8 12 8;12 8 16 4 16;8 14 16 6 13;5 14 16 15 9;6 13 6 15 5;5 7 15 15 11;12 5 16 4 13;12 16 12 9 9;14 15 12 7 5;7 15 12 11 4", "game-20:1",
  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether a wrong against me can be paid off or only paid back. The first ruler to cross me will find out which, and will be the measure for all the rest. I do not know yet what a conqueror is to me, a criminal or a teacher. The first city that changes hands in my sight will decide it, for its taker and for me.",
  "Fo\0772 Wh\0772", "", 95, "forgiveness=unwritten\077 warhate=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 21", "Oman", "", "6 5 5 4 4 4 4 4 5 4 5 5", "", "", "15 10 14 12 14;15 16 16 10 7;9 13 4 9 10;12 13 5 8 8;15 13 13 8 4;12 4 6 4 10;10 16 13 13 6;13 4 14 8 10;13 7 5 8 12;7 16 9 6 11;6 13 8 16 6;16 9 8 14 16", "game-21:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. No one has wronged me yet, and I do not know what I do to the first who does; whatever it is, everyone after will expect it. I do not know yet what a weak neighbour is to me: someone to shelter, or land lying open. The first I meet will teach me.",
  "Fo\0771 Me\0771", "", 62, "forgiveness=unwritten\077 meanness=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 22", "Oman", "Yugoslavia", "6 5 4 4 4 4 6 6 4 5 4 5", "5 5 4 5 5 5 5 5 4 6 5 4", "", "8 6 16 4 7;11 6 5 13 6;14 14 11 16 11;12 5 9 13 9;8 16 8 10 4;5 13 13 4 10;8 9 4 9 4;11 4 5 10 16;14 4 13 5 10;4 4 4 5 4;8 16 8 10 11;15 12 6 14 9", "game-22:1",
  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nThe small courts mean little to me. They are safe from me while they are no use to my rivals, and no longer. No one sitting here is more this way than I am. I do not suffer in silence. What I lack I ask for by name, and I remember who gave, who haggled and who looked away. Of all the crowns here, mine holds to this hardest. A ruler who swallows their neighbours sickens me, and the first city they take makes them my business, wherever it stands. No one sitting here is more this way than I am.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what a weak neighbour is to me: someone to shelter, or land lying open. The first I meet will teach me. I do not know yet whether I am one who names an enemy before the whole table or one who smiles until the hour. The first ruler I come to despise will get one or the other, and the table will know me by it.",
  "Mi-2 Ne+3 Wh+1 Me\0771 De\0771", "", 196, "minor=table- neediness=table+ warhate=table+ meanness=unwritten\077 denounce=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 23", "Oman", "", "6 6 5 6 4 6 5 5 4 5 6 4", "", "", "4 7 8 14 5;12 11 5 7 15;10 12 13 10 4;4 4 16 15 4;6 10 4 7 7;5 6 4 10 14;9 8 7 13 6;5 13 4 16 4;10 14 7 6 7;8 16 4 14 15;15 6 6 12 13;14 7 15 4 12", "game-23:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether I am one who asks or one who takes. The first time I lack what a neighbour has in plenty will settle it, for that neighbour and for all the others. I do not know yet what I do when one crown grows heavier than all the rest: lean against it, or sell it my friendship. The first ruler to rise that far will learn which, and so will those hoping for my help.",
  "Ne\0772 Ba\0771", "", 89, "neediness=unwritten\077 balance=unwritten\077" },
