  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether I am a ruler who has friends or one who has uses for people. The first hand offered me across this table will be answered one way or the other, and the answer will stick. I do not know yet whether I am one who asks or one who takes. The first time I lack what a neighbour has in plenty will settle it, for that neighbour and for all the others.",
  "Fr\0772 Ne\0772", "", 102, "friendship=unwritten\077 neediness=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 25", "Oman", "", "4 4 5 6 4 4 5 5 5 4 5 6", "", "", "4 13 5 16 10;11 15 7 12 6;7 8 10 6 15;11 8 6 9 6;11 8 16 4 6;6 14 9 12 14;8 16 5 6 7;5 7 9 5 13;13 4 16 15 9;13 12 6 16 5;15 9 9 6 13;5 5 9 14 10", "game-25:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nHesitation looks to me like weakness, in others and in myself. When a door stands open I am through it before the thought is finished. In this I go further than anyone at this table.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet what a weak neighbour is to me: someone to shelter, or land lying open. The first I meet will teach me. I have not yet watched a neighbour fall to a stronger one. Whether I see a wrong to answer, a warning or a meal is not written, and the first fall will write it.",
  "Bo+3 Me\0771 Ba\0772", "", 104, "boldness=table+ balance=unwritten\077 meanness=unwritten\077" },
{ "flat 26", "Oman", "Yugoslavia", "4 4 4 6 4 4 6 4 6 6 4 5", "5 5 5 5 4 5 5 5 4 4 6 6", "", "11 11 7 5 13;14 5 12 5 10;4 10 13 16 10;15 5 4 12 15;14 11 14 6 10;12 13 14 5 15;14 10 5 5 12;4 8 6 12 6;10 15 4 16 13;7 16 16 7 10;5 12 13 16 6;13 10 5 16 4", "game-26:1",
  "I rule Oman and Yugoslavia, two crowns on one head, and on most things they speak as one.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. I do not know yet whether a wrong against me can be paid off or only paid back. The first ruler to cross me will find out which, and will be the measure for all the rest. I have not yet stood over anyone who could not stop me, and I do not know what I do there. Whatever I do the first time, I expect I will do again.",
  "Fo\0772 Me\0772", "", 94, "forgiveness=unwritten\077 meanness=unwritten\077" },
