{ "flat 29", "Oman", "", "4 4 6 4 6 4 5 4 5 4 6 6", "", "", "10 16 11 16 13;13 4 4 14 5;13 12 16 12 13;7 15 5 16 16;7 15 13 15 11;16 16 5 4 5;10 11 14 11 12;10 14 7 14 13;6 14 9 10 10;10 15 13 4 15;4 11 4 16 13;12 6 7 16 8", "game-29:1",
  "I rule Oman.\n\nLet the others watch each other. I watch my own ground, and I am patient with everyone except the one who puts a hand on it. In this I go further than anyone at this table.\n\nThe rest of me is unwritten. No one has wronged me yet, and I do not know what I do to the first who does; whatever it is, everyone after will expect it. I do not know yet whether I am one who asks or one who takes. The first time I lack what a neighbour has in plenty will settle it, for that neighbour and for all the others.",
